{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e0ecce9bfe04cd236fb98236b5036d80ccd3334070f01df6f4a6451abb004b1f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"004eec916c90adfa747437c871a583b03dd53ef165c77c2268156661e1a8f17e","logical_entry_identity":"292114c5c42d9a65a038443f6e72351bfcc864273d431dfe6bd90c933c84749f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Reclaiming Garkul's Heritage","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"夺回加库尔的遗产"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a072e09616b24e20c18da425c866f848a76bee1f97aa51db98c2fbc4d35ba8c3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1ca15fbc35337ba2563d9a46422f01b13be528bbfe393dbbaca4328fea23271c","logical_entry_identity":"79d68b2db473707ceb56bf148eb13742f47705d349f92e8e288d9860be111216","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Firmly plant your steamsaws in the ground, using them to propel yourself very quickly (+%d%% movement speed).\n\t\tAny foes on either side of your movement get wrecked by the saws, knocking them 3 tiles away from you.\n\t\tAttacking or using any talent will break this effect.\n\t\tWhen this effect is broken or cancelled the sudden change in motion deals %d%% weapon damage to all foes around you. To do full damage you need to have moved at least 5 times, otherwise damage is lower (or null for no movement).\n\t\t#{italic}#The wheels of death! Amazing!#{normal}#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"把蒸汽链锯牢牢插入地面，借助它们推动自己快速移动（移动速度增加 %d%%）。\n\t\t在你移动路线两侧的敌人会被链锯撕碎，并被击退 3 码。\n\t\t攻击或使用任何技能都会中断该效果。\n\t\t当该效果被中断或取消时，运动的骤变会对周围所有敌人造成 %d%% 武器伤害。至少移动 5 次才能造成全额伤害，否则伤害降低（未移动则无伤害）。\n\t\t#{italic}#死亡之轮！太棒了！#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"75d31ca44bbe3cb83b3fd3f15ebe445df3c69778b0c88faef6b0dee8f1f3affe","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"27c0ff1b23b7c7478445deaad2459ec80dbc952849e804608a4bb3bf0a5a4c4a","logical_entry_identity":"a1e44354da8daa35a563c7e319447a1dc9f93e4a0a650425c216f17b5f68675a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"While inside a psionic fog the quantum state of space is warped by your powerful tech-augmented psionic powers.\n\t\tWhen you would get hit you instead find yourself in an adjacent location.\n\t\tThis effect has a cooldown.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"身处灵能之雾中时，空间的量子态会被你那经科技强化的强大灵能扭曲。\n\t\t当你即将被击中时，你会改为出现在相邻位置。\n\t\t这个效果有冷却时间。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"32c1ffbae03da0f6c49f8e25b6ffee1f5d57462a409ef43cc6457e6c51bfc824","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"2c040c2ce6df49a1bc731241b10eccc435387edc938c8091e5badf389b7fe16e","logical_entry_identity":"8416169ac41300375fa24ff597edfb69e28c10d9f0b28ea463ab33f34810583c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You fire a special explosive shot with your steamgun(s) at a spot within range.\n\t\tWhen each shot reaches its target, it does normal steamgun damage and explodes within radius %d, which does %0.2f physical damage.\n\t\tThis talent does not use ammo as it is the ammo.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你用蒸汽枪向射程内某处射出特殊的爆炸弹。\n\t\t每发子弹命中目标时，造成正常蒸汽枪伤害，并在半径 %d 码内爆炸，造成 %0.2f 物理伤害。\n\t\t这个技能不消耗弹药，因为它本身就是弹药。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d58853505e80df905e1984b7cc718f5667b5a8fe962ade71a90b8bffbbe9d70","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"2c3ff698a5048820725e2b7382db67a213d731d56c1fbd83285085591bbb62f8","logical_entry_identity":"1c0adf5c3d8da0cbde3ef29118d57e4fd53eef9c4d5bc831824b92117993082b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Did you know the Sher'Tul had brothers?  Long before their creation, when the gods were still young and gleeful, Quekjora convinced them they could work together to bring life to Eyal. Perhaps they could have, were they more mature at the time...  Eager cooperation withered under exposure to personal tastes and creative differences, the friendships of our creators turned to animosity, and yet we were still made.\n \nWe had no overt flaws.  The gods were mercilessly vigilant, eager to use any imperfections as an excuse to berate their perpetrator and claim superiority, and thus we were only allowed to live when they were out of ammunition to use.  We seemed perfect, even to a deep inspection...\n \nI doubt any of them deliberately cursed us - no one of them could've done something so powerful.  Subconscious touches, psychic leakage, and other such imperceptible forces added up over time to indicate one inescapable truth: we were not wanted.  We had been forged in a bitter compromise, one desired by nobody involved; their hatred, their neglect, their frustration is the foundation of everything we are, and we carry it deep within ourselves.  Perhaps such a creature naturally attracts the ire of the universe, of fate itself. \n\nOr maybe we just angered someone powerful enough to put a retroactive temporal curse on us, or it was Amakthel personally ensuring his pet project would have no equals. We may never be certain.  All we know is, something - be it probability, or the universe's combined will, or simply our own bad luck - will not tolerate our existence, nor that of anything like us.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你知道夏·图尔人有兄弟吗？早在他们诞生之前，众神尚且年轻快活时，奎克久拉说服他们携手为埃亚尔创造生命。如果当时更加成熟，也许他们真能做到……但热忱的合作经不起个人品味与创意分歧的考验，我们的创造者从朋友变成仇敌，而我们仍然诞生了。\n\n我们没有明显的缺陷。众神冷酷地监视着彼此，急于用任何瑕疵作为斥责始作俑者、宣称自己更优越的借口；直到他们再也找不到可以攻击的把柄，我们才获准存在。我们看上去完美无缺，即便细细检查也是如此……\n\n我不认为众神中有谁故意诅咒了我们——他们当中没有任何一位能独自做到如此强大的事。潜意识的触碰、灵能泄漏和其他难以察觉的力量日积月累，最终指向一个无法逃避的事实：我们不受欢迎。我们在一场苦涩的妥协中被铸就，而参与者无一真正想要我们；他们的仇恨、忽视与挫败构成了我们的一切，并深深留在我们体内。也许这样的生物天生就会招致宇宙乃至命运本身的愤怒。\n\n又或许，我们只是激怒了某个强大到足以给我们施加追溯性时空诅咒的存在；也可能是阿马克泰尔本人要确保他的得意之作无可匹敌。我们或许永远无法确定。我们只知道，某种事物——无论是概率、宇宙的共同意志，还是单纯属于我们自己的厄运——都不会容忍我们或任何与我们相似的事物存在。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8c4cec233fae6b60b5d7fd0513fabae06d7738e843f7075910ac0243296fccc8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"2d921b9b023f066aaa26a926141450bbc15e1c346675269c4675d313932c4bd8","logical_entry_identity":"714d74ae4a1e5ffa211e78f31c145416989cd3930fbbe73bf33420b6f68e7faa","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Radiant Horrorc","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"光芒恐兽人"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fa8f8c4008d2602dd2c7d3955ce45b33ef9f58ac2165d9d075eec6f0457cc951","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"43407aa996e17670ff10721d4649565afb853a937b6fd4a570c8932d77c6f96b","logical_entry_identity":"918f7bc32e379fcd32d6c21f58e456ec9145dfdc5dc1eb212fe239fcb09d3869","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Dominion Port ???","source_tag":"_t","target":"巨魔帝国港口 ???"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"095942b6f9211369e09d548e66ee642948fbabc2745ed0f39001e86262358bf0","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"4589d38432175d1b8b980ccf5d7e351d49f20c2ac4eca30707be70d143057ae1","logical_entry_identity":"59f4b0a2c334f11d6516ab8ab16878c66d4346fdd9481ef2324e84839aef65ea","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Trelle,\n\nI respect your intentions and your dedication to our safety, which is the only reason I'm not handing this letter over to Aeryn right this second.  Do you have the faintest clue what this treaty is buying us?  Do you really think we could have kept the Prides' remnants from banding together and becoming, at a minimum, a massive thorn in our side for the next few decades without King Tolak's help? Even if I disagreed with Aeryn that the Orcs deserve a chance of redemption, this treaty is ensuring an [i]extraordinary[/i] amount of help from a nation that, last year, still tolerated roving gangs of mage-lynchers.\n\nI'll spare you the speech about insubordination, lying, and bypassing the chain of command, because a: technically you were \"only\" asking me to commit those crimes, and b: I've got better things to do than write up a full-blown reprimand for someone who I'm [i]certain[/i] knows exactly what they're doing wrong.  Instead, I'll cut to the chase: Never even think of pulling something like this again.  I'm saving your letter, and if you're ever involved in a questionable use of force, I'm submitting it as evidence.  I thought you were better than this.\n\n-Outpost Leader John","source_tag":"_t","target":"特瑞尔，\n\n我尊重你的本意，也尊重你为保障我们安全所付出的努力；这是我没有立刻把这封信交给艾琳的唯一原因。你对这份条约为我们换来了什么，哪怕有一点概念吗？你真以为没有托拉克国王的帮助，我们还能阻止各部落残余联合起来，并至少在未来几十年里成为我们的巨大麻烦吗？就算我不同意艾琳女士认为兽人应当获得救赎机会的看法，这份条约也确保了我们能从一个国家那里获得[i]巨量[/i]援助——而就在去年，这个国家还在容忍四处游荡的法师私刑团伙。\n\n关于抗命、撒谎和越过指挥链，我就不训斥你了，因为：第一，严格来说你“只是”在要求我犯下这些过错；第二，我有更要紧的事要做，而不是给一个我[i]确信[/i]完全清楚自己错在哪里的人写一篇长篇大论的斥责。我就直说了：永远别再想干这种事。我会留着你的信；如果你今后牵涉任何可疑的武力使用，我就会把它作为证据提交。我原以为你不至于如此。\n\n-前哨站队长约翰"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"13dcf923eec29e011db150c9f2c5790f28753fbfca8f846a9cf84dcf278e3551","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6be94e1427098f03d2dae10d07e2e51a2cd4cd976c986112f0fbfcb934236c6b","logical_entry_identity":"7c9cc912b25c059daa94197026d751bb4ba59278e255c3e6e55c867f66619d19","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The target feels the echoes of all light and dark damage it takes. Light damage slows the target by %0.2f%% per point of damage dealt, up to a maximum of %d%% at %d damage. Dark damage creates an effect at the tile for %d turns which deals %d%% of the damage dealt each turn. It will be refreshed as long as the target continues taking damage from it or another source.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标会感受到其所受光系与暗影伤害的回响。每受到 1 点光系伤害，目标便减速 %0.2f%%，减速上限为 %d%%，累计受到 %d 点伤害时达到上限。暗影伤害会在目标地格生成一个持续 %d 回合的效果，每回合造成相当于该次暗影伤害 %d%% 的伤害。只要目标继续受到该效果或其他来源的伤害，持续时间就会刷新。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eccb09d9d6be3a685e1474caf604d9c71245356a96612d362a4165b631202b88","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6db2f294906fff41d56e00261622dd9e0a4b6198c83f3da7b942759e8eb947b1","logical_entry_identity":"a860fc316a46641c8d3dc4d7f689ae1d49cee0b3085843ccaa7ed296d66f49d0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You replace your steamgun and attack with a lightning-charged staff to engage in close combat.\n\t\t\n\t\tDeals %d%% steamgun damage as lightning to enemies in a frontal arc, as well as reducing the damage they deal by %d%% for 3 turns. This counts as a melee attack but triggers ammunition on-hit effects. All shockstaff attacks will also make a shield slam for the same damage as lightning. \n\n\t\tYou can charge up to your steamgun's range to make shockstaff attacks.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你将蒸汽枪换成一根带电的电击棒，进行近身格斗。\n\n\t\t对正面弧形范围内的敌人造成 %d%% 蒸汽枪伤害的闪电伤害，并使其造成的伤害降低 %d%%，持续 3 回合。此攻击视为近战攻击，但会触发弹药的命中效果。所有电击棒攻击还会发动一次盾牌攻击，造成等量的闪电伤害。\n\n\t\t你可以从不超过蒸汽枪射程的距离发起冲锋，然后用电击棒攻击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"df243206f5ee84821dbb9e8211f8fae545f513739e34f7ecf4ff947ad447b22a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7f99d3a4c36467a6069520d436a4b304a376e1f484a80c58dc3494c959a76d54","logical_entry_identity":"f6335d714d63a20bc4f5705b8e27ebc05639fc222e4356549325352e7d908f12","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"elven astromancer","source_tag":"entity name","target":"精灵星术师"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"72c33b50465ad92e7fab8d4c527927f90b0bc9e3254d700bf881519ce6a044ab","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7fa3e29aa2417f6a5dba60630342bc1524ddb6a85728a7b0b5411636e5c107bc","logical_entry_identity":"38ae9e5c3a32600d5d1ee44613b787285b74f5e67fd71f2028657b423b21bace","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Automated Portable Extractor","source_tag":"entity name","target":"便携式自动材料提取仪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"942f553cdb240c5aae16bca30835327bef960c53a8f20dd4fdb00dcd825b982e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7fbe123262a3bef2293b8a3dc676f7f763f5b64b6398b0cbfb9e1b5475017158","logical_entry_identity":"3d4b3191b733500ddb311456342a0b590ecd049065b69f1cf485d6cdbf2047e4","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"A small orb infused with the power of the Sun.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个注入了太阳能量的小球。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1249621df4dd001142a336be505d3a3f72354b7320f5f5a0e83da4798f07c05b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7fbe8ad5e5858179e69f79ac4e27c6930f6c5186594321ee99be49ea09874143","logical_entry_identity":"8c9ad7f52ed6a0101482289374cad1864dd2603b5e42ba2eac1055c66c82cb32","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"ritch hunter","source_tag":"entity name","target":"里奇猎手"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8e9b4139290e885a1cd3dca32c05ac5375d4b2f273ef170c0e30dcddfa750a81","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7fcdc1c6ac5d36e5b700d0ec4f7d74b9b4ef6941a974dcaafa29188b9d26ebad","logical_entry_identity":"387f81d37e887984a5bb71c3ef9676213c6b6b03ab23197a47faf47ca4793d8a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"*Sobs*","source_tag":"_t","target":"*哭泣*"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a7ae6ce275c6bc883d1fa062a9223441147beb8c8367d9a8704a73847214fdac","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7fe5c1d18d9398bf2f9523298c95a625c910b076ff5ff328fdd7943c3eb9292b","logical_entry_identity":"397b543fd5bbabe95e8b751deec478d62803b88ac36164983a7163723cfc8a33","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"curse of amakthel","source_tag":"damage type","target":"阿马克泰尔的诅咒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f8422e1702daf1e5691e3d299aceba26bbd336c049a9ca8b8c716fbd66b88d9f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"7fea2a4e2b3110ea3dca67a50593d37b2c3404353d3d2247bd4faf18970e39c0","logical_entry_identity":"b72000ea5e4bfc048df59fe0eab19da420be16fab8b1a092348a942f0e56f60a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Implant: Steam Generator","source_tag":"talent name","target":"植入物：蒸汽制造机"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"20a72afda1b4e0f1eda14525afd7ff981e4ab1b8747954b3f68640f8f130f28c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"80102c7fbb4556b367a30ced65e5083c0667148ca951b8180b262fc6970e10aa","logical_entry_identity":"a59a778c62b29cbce22b7e5c4b7a93f20adfe298c9e569b538b6e08c3e772989","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"battlefield management","source_tag":"talent type","target":"战地控制"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"015301bb935da49a820f37a27730f5925bd92919d39a0fdc661cbaf1d7ed681e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"8015bc798ab5b72e83f70a585c69ac51dece1fb3e0baaa8d8059f84ec1d9f336","logical_entry_identity":"ff9722d044c800efede5c59f2b7a54660f788de72efea1da741805511f0cf9