_order":null,"call_locator":"ad978292bf245040f9f48c3829572d2b30685ab9a0fb00abbed1fc3c8d438326","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"817980913905fef1587c42a71e1b7406ff29c473dc3906bb50284c61daab408e","logical_entry_identity":"610b40778d80d8d2ed07a920ea07774a2e14d1dc11f89d9224bc33ec957af2d0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Go to the Ritch Hive in the mountains north of the Erúan desert and collect a big pile of ritch eggs.  About 30 viable eggs should be sufficient.","source_tag":"_t","target":"前去艾露安沙漠以北群山中的里奇巢穴，收集大量的里奇虫卵。大约 30 个可孵化的虫卵便已足够。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6253c0092501f283a1042cf4380720131843d7ff39fb07c6e4ac2c33ae1eab13","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"81877a4e3a96facf363b82e0250744b416a42bb3b35146f261b77bb7f05df98d","logical_entry_identity":"9c2e47cbf48a4e1019a1a264cf67755e5341c83ed031a594a89909b75023609f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You fire a special steamsaw shot with your steamgun(s) at a target for %d%% physical weapon damage.\n\t\tThe steamsaw will cut into the target, doing %d%% physical weapon damage over 5 turns.\n\t\tThis talent does not use ammo as it is the ammo.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使用蒸汽枪发射特殊蒸汽链锯弹，造成 %d%% 物理武器伤害。\n\t\t蒸汽链锯会切入目标，在 5 回合内造成 %d%% 物理武器伤害。\n\t\t这个技能本身就是弹药，因此不消耗弹药。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6d2f371a3e489ebdc6f9cd3b6d909db7a5d4b5acc511288583f84a79b636a2a0","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"818895ac34cb1cc6bbbd428b9c465131a39ed60738a44716b3706f97db12548f","logical_entry_identity":"ec3b5786059b720c52bf145d3c2319ae3bb388cc14f4f2e8582211f832b46c21","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Do you know what would've happened if you hadn't stepped up to defend Kruk Pride?  The Allied Kingdoms could've gone on to keep the entire world under its thumb.  One unified army, marching under one banner, ready to eliminate us when we're reborn...  and that's assuming that a certain greater threat didn't step in first.  We don't want that, and neither do you.\n\nDeception is beneath us; if there's one thing our creation taught us, it's that respect and alliance are unnecessary for cooperation, if there's an immediate common need to be fulfilled.  We've prepared some of this machinery to enhance your abilities, and grant you new knowledge...  it will serve you well in preserving Eyal's immediate existence, and granting the Orcs a land of their own.  A land that'll have to fight to survive, fending off the Dominion, the Allied Kingdoms, the warped Mal'Rokka calling themselves demons, the Naloren remnants...  and I wouldn't want to spoil the fun by saying what other sorts of special guests are arriving.  Don't worry, we won't be giving anyone an unfair advantage; you, and they, would just stab us in the back anyway.\n\nThe storm is coming.  It's going to be a bloodbath.  We see no need to be present for it, not until the last man is standing, wounded and exhausted, atop a pile of corpses.  He'll be an easy target.\n\nYou could always give up.  Stop fighting.  Let the Allied Kingdoms have Eyal, and be the latest in a long line of factors conspiring to prevent our rebirth.  Sacrifice your people to \"save Eyal\" from having us on it.  You won't, though, because you have something we'll never have: hope.  Hope that we can be fought off, that our return won't come in your lifetime.  Our predictions aren't 100% accurate anyway; who are we to take that hope from you?\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你知道，若你没有挺身保卫克鲁克部落，会发生什么吗？联合王国本可以继续把整个世界踩在脚下。一支统一的军队，共举一面旗帜，在我们重生时随时准备消灭我们……而这还得假定某个更大的威胁没有抢先介入。我们不想看到那一幕，你也一样。\n\n我们不屑于欺骗；创造我们的经历若教会了我们什么，那便是：只要眼前存在必须共同满足的需求，合作并不需要尊重或结盟。我们准备了一些机械来增强你的能力，并赋予你新的知识……它们能很好地帮助你维系埃亚尔眼下的存续，也能帮兽人赢得自己的土地。一片必须为生存而战的土地，要抵御巨魔帝国、联合王国、那些自称恶魔的扭曲玛·洛克人、纳鲁精灵的残部……至于还有哪些特别来宾正在赶来，我可不想提前扫兴。放心，我们不会给任何一方不公平的优势；反正你和他们最后都会从背后捅我们一刀。\n\n风暴将至，必成血海。我们没必要亲临，至少在最后一个人遍体鳞伤、筋疲力尽地站在尸堆上之前没有必要。那时，他会是轻而易举的目标。\n\n你随时可以放弃，停止战斗。把埃亚尔让给联合王国，成为漫长历史上又一个合谋阻止我们重生的因素。牺牲你的人民，从我们存在于埃亚尔这件事中“拯救埃亚尔”。但你不会，因为你拥有我们永远不会有的东西：希望。希望你们能击退我们，希望我们的回归不会发生在你有生之年。反正我们的预测也并非百分之百准确；我们又有什么资格夺走你的希望呢？\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ef2fe3a177decb94282c7d5afaafbdffc96b13c9540a76035594b8b08d88e368","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"81b467a75b09c2a619ad945981d049f7ad4600dc5baa2704aed19e70a47f660a","logical_entry_identity":"bea04238f1cc611428bdb5c6c4c70fe059eb406b8226dd24279d4c18b7a6ae11","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"This steam giant carries a steamgun in each hand. The barrels appear to be flaming.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个蒸汽巨人双手各拿着一把枪管在燃烧的蒸汽枪。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"83fcee1e7574895d35b6542449374c64946a931c86f38434c62981c2d7bc28e6","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"81fd07cded4449333e968226b765093b41f90fdf9795d80615433ed081140776","logical_entry_identity":"910b89d4a0f3f2799685947774cd90a3e7f187e55d7c0b2450032c7b8497ccd2","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# 14","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#每等级生命加值：#LIGHT_BLUE# 14"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a788fad9d28cd5b83b03f17d93b8596bc96c09bec8483de4741437d3c292f81c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"8219fc9dbd4084c00a114ef5b0f8af5cc2a06ee6303b54f7d7205943f9308485","logical_entry_identity":"445fa9c6f5a6905ea68d462c3dc5fd55cb251124b0a38fdebecd2ffe8d05d258","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Sunstone","source_tag":"entity name","target":"太阳石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"00c64c5bd39b21a064384881a7ca191125fe0a02d376063aa7017eadc0f03ac8","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"821f0a6d51b717c029742db05a6190bdc4beedff271779b9a74347cfb3d520a4","logical_entry_identity":"c68c36f041c96947602fa746d0963ab134ea4ccee7520cae7810a07d54f67eb7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"-Pain Enhancement System","source_tag":"_t","target":"-痛苦强化系统"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e5e20d70ea8cda81d0ed8fd0dcd7bf7a3f77370f58c704aa05b000eab3c8d1d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"82234b245c76d6a03f2ded3ddc5c1d1ad19bc85f8a00ed1bbb540ef56a7732